===Etymology===
From {{L.}} ''[[incongruus]]'', [[in-]] (not) + [[congruus]].

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Not [[similar]] or [[congruent]]; not [[matching]] or [[fitting]] in.
#:''The old camper looked a bit '''incongruous''' in an upscale neighborhood, but he enjoyed traveling in it.''

